This prototype does not copy OpenCode source or logo files. Names are used to
identify the server this client speaks to.

The Helium compiler is a separate project, Apache License 2.0, written by
Anthony Reffelt (Amniscient): https://github.com/Amnibro/helium
It is cloned at build time and is not vendored here. The companion core in
helium/app.amni is part of this MIT tree. Gold (https://github.com/Amnibro/gold)
was not used. Its translator calls a paid model.

Chat reactions follow the behavior of the grok-remote web UI
(https://github.com/Amnibro/grok-remote, commit bda2d78, AGPL-3.0).
That repository was only a reference. None of its source is included here.

